msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Wow, that soon?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ого, так скоро?"

#: scenario:scenario_EC65AB1C_AFDA_4E56_AB18_EC1F7656D023
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
